-- dataflow, SPLIT AND BOTH HALVES IRREDUCIBLE FOR DIFFERENT REASONS, which is
--   what earns the axis this layer rather than a preference: `axis_earns[audit]`
--   wants the refinement to make the model say something DIFFERENT about two
